er and  it gives me great pleasure to introduce  her to you tonight and to present her  with this well-earned fellowship Sarah  Jane  [Applause]  Wow Thank You Juliet so much that was  sweet thank you and thank you to our  actors and to Roderigo Daffy for putting  on this live read it is incredible in  such a treat for all of us so thank you  very much for your time thank you  you know the scene that you just saw is  one that's very close to my heart where  Macy's mother is teaching her about the  importance of helping others this is a  lesson that I was taught by my parents  who are here tonight Carrie and David  Edwards I was taught this lesson by both  of them not only did they tell me  verbally how important it is to help  others but they demonstrated in their  lives every day  they have both dedicated their lives to  helping others as physicians that work  with cancer patients and as you heard  Julia say I'm personally have benefited  so much from the work of doctors so when  I looked at my career my ambitions I  thought oh right how am I going to help  others with what I want to do which is  to make movies and I have to say I felt  a little bit intimidated comparing  myself to people who literally save  lives so when I brought this quandary to  my dad who's sitting up there tonight I  said how you know how am I supposed to  compare myself to what you do how am I  supposed to help others and he gave me a  bit of advice that really stuck with me  to this day he said some people save  lives  some people make them worth living so um  yeah so I think that's what all of us  here are trying to do when we make films  we're trying to make what life worth  living whether that's by providing some  entertainment a laugh a shared  experience or maybe it's by advocating  for a cause or representing someone so  that they can sit in a seat and look up  at the screen and see someone just like  them accomplishing great things so I  just really want to thank the Academy  Joan Greg everybody who put in their  time to this fellowship to give us the  opportunity to do just that this next  year I am grateful beyond words for that  I'd like to thank all of my family for  my mom and dad and brother who are here  tonight I'd like to thank my boyfriend  Kenny I love you I'd like to thank all  of my friends especially aleksef Kylee  Schmidt Kelly Martin all of my friends  here tonight I'd like to thank my  managers at Kaplan Peron and I'd like to  give a shout out to applause for a cause  which you heard about at Northwestern  University and finally I'd like to  dedicate this award to my grandma Glenda  I miss you and I love you thank you  [Applause]
 

